      "updated": 1794639609388,
      "created": 1794635614117,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": ".zshrc is personal startup script\nthat has commands and will be executed\nwhen  terminal is opened \n\nZsh = name of terminal\nrc = run commands\n\n.zshrc is hidden file presnt in home folder    \n~ represents home folder of user\n\n\nEx:-\nload api keys for our software programs like \nclaude... or \nload cloaud access keys ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": ".zshrc is personal startup script\nthat has commands and will be executed\nwhen  terminal is opened \n\nZsh = name of terminal\nrc = run commands\n\n.zshrc is hidden file presnt in home folder    \n~ represents home folder of user\n\n\nEx:-\nload api keys for our software programs like \nclaude... or \nload cloaud access keys ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
